### Page 2 of 2

```text
NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the City of Cheyenne Governing Body hereby
acknowledges receipt of the Archer Trail Connector Plan to be used as a guide for the final
design of the trails and bicycle facilities to the Archer Complex.
PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED THIS
DAY OF
2019.
Marian J. Orr, Mayor
(Seal)
ATTEST:
Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
